# ============================================================
# 邓俊辉《数据结构(C++语言版)》配套源码 — .gitignore
# 适用 Visual Studio 2019 / C++ 桌面工程
# ============================================================

# ---------- Visual Studio 用户级 / IDE 缓存 ----------
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
*.vshistory/

# ---------- VS 数据库 / 浏览信息 ----------
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.cachefile
*.aps
*.ncb
*.opendb
*.opensdf
*.bdb

# ---------- 编译输出目录 ----------
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# ---------- 编译中间产物 / 链接产物 ----------
*.obj
*.iobj
*.pch
*.pdb
*.ipdb
*.idb
*.ilk
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.exp
*.map
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.unsuccessfulbuild
*.log
*.cache
*.diagsession
*.dmp

# ---------- 临时 / 备份文件 ----------
*~
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
*.tmp
*.~*

# ---------- 预处理 / 模板实例化中间文件 ----------
*.i
*.ii
*.ipp.cpp

# ---------- 其他编辑器 / IDE ----------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace

# ---------- 操作系统 ----------
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# ---------- 备注 ----------
# _input/ 与 _output/ 为测试数据 / 运行结果，按需保留，默认不忽略。
# 如运行结果无需入库，可取消下面注释：
# _output/
